    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an exciting hidden object adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse locations - from a cozy farm to a pastry shop and even a mysterious medieval castle! Search for hundreds of hidden objects and challenge yourself in the new &quot;Layers&quot; mode. Play your way: complete tasks in any order, whether starting with mini-games or diving straight into the search! You'll need attentiveness and logic to solve puzzles and find all the items on your list.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/2ceb5f88ae4cbb3a4e0760c12c85a408.poster.avif?t=1755000046\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/2ceb5f88ae4cbb3a4e0760c12c85a408.webm?t=1755000046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/2ceb5f88ae4cbb3a4e0760c12c85a408.mp4?t=1755000046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exclusive Collector's Edition with bonuses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This edition includes:<br>\u2022 5 additional themes with 10 new locations<br>\u2022 Beautiful desktop wallpapers<br>\u2022 Music player with the game soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/988f30a546632353ad8eba0c02be5c05.poster.avif?t=1755000046\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/988f30a546632353ad8eba0c02be5c05.webm?t=1755000046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/988f30a546632353ad8eba0c02be5c05.mp4?t=1755000046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the exciting world of hidden object searches and discover all the secrets of this incredible game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an exciting hidden object adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse locations - from a cozy farm to a pastry shop and even a mysterious medieval castle! Search for hundreds of hidden objects and challenge yourself in the new &quot;Layers&quot; mode. Play your way: complete tasks in any order, whether starting with mini-games or diving straight into the search! You'll need attentiveness and logic to solve puzzles and find all the items on your list.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/2ceb5f88ae4cbb3a4e0760c12c85a408.poster.avif?t=1755000046\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/2ceb5f88ae4cbb3a4e0760c12c85a408.webm?t=1755000046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/2ceb5f88ae4cbb3a4e0760c12c85a408.mp4?t=1755000046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exclusive Collector's Edition with bonuses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This edition includes:<br>\u2022 5 additional themes with 10 new locations<br>\u2022 Beautiful desktop wallpapers<br>\u2022 Music player with the game soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/988f30a546632353ad8eba0c02be5c05.poster.avif?t=1755000046\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/988f30a546632353ad8eba0c02be5c05.webm?t=1755000046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957860/extras/988f30a546632353ad8eba0c02be5c05.mp4?t=1755000046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the exciting world of hidden object searches and discover all the secrets of this incredible game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
